Rāma spots Rāvaṇa's roaring chariot advancing --- Rāma bids Mātali meet the foe steadily --- Mātali circles Rāvaṇa's chariot in dust --- Rāvaṇa showers Rāma with arrows --- Rāma grasps Indra's bow for duel --- Gods gather hoping for Rāvaṇa's fall --- Dire omens beset Rāvaṇa's chariot --- Bright omens promise Rāma victory --- Rāma rejoices and fights harder
